{# The first stop on every full page: a keyboard or screen-reader user can jump past the header and
   the navigation to the content (WCAG 2.4.1). Hidden until it has the focus. The target is the
   page's <main id="main-content" tabindex="-1">; a page that has more to skip inside main (the
   dashboard's module navigation) passes the id of its own content. A macro, so that the page's
   `text` is a parameter and no variable has to come from the context. #}
{% macro skip_link(text, target="main-content") -%}
<a class="skip-link" href="#{{ target }}">{{ text.skip_to_content }}</a>
{%- endmacro %}
